<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11285" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ-ᾰλείφω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαλήλιφα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					52.29
				</span></i>
			:—<i>wipe off, expunge,</i> esp. from a record or
			register, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				45.44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀπὸ ὀφλήματος καθ᾽ ὅτι ἂν
					ἐκτίνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					58.50
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι τῶν δεδογμένων</span>
			<i>cancel</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.160
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀπὸ τῶν παρακαταθηκῶν</span>
			<i>embezzle</i> part of the deposits, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				52.27
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>erase,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Themist.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be erased,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				34i14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρίας ἐπιστολὰς ἓν δάκρυον
					ἀπαλείφει μητρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
